WEBVTT


00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.440
Look what a simple idea to make your store full!

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.280
The confectioner is preparing the product at the front.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:07.702
Thus, 

00:00:07.702 --> 00:00:10.320
the protagonism is not a simple packaging

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.440
and yes the pastry chef's relationship

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.400
with the sweet,

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.160
awakening attention from those on the street.

